bbs.title("After Hours // arcade guide")
bbs.text("SIGNAL HUNT: tune 1-99 in seven guesses. Higher/lower hints help.")
bbs.text("Win for 100 points per remaining guess, including the winning turn.")
bbs.text("Q leaves a hunt. An abandoned or lost hunt earns no score.")
bbs.text("NEON SALVAGE: choose safe salvage or risk energy hacking caches.")
bbs.text("Five sectors, four energy. Land early to bank your local points.")
bbs.text("A finished run saves once. Play again starts a fresh run.")
bbs.text("Top tens and personal bests belong to this BBS. No real currency.")
bbs.text("Ctrl-C returns to the BBS. Disconnect/resize abandons a live run.")
bbs.option("H", "Play Signal Hunt", "game:signal-hunt")
bbs.option("N", "Play Neon Salvage", "game:neon-salvage")
